    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:afc66ddc0a99d5d340615910",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "该说她真不愧是“女帝”吧。\n想起再次见识到那居高临下的风格时，\n令人深感敬佩。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b8e76153918837c97f6a4557410501e017c1b15099558546050c9026757e770d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
